@page "/super/help"
@layout paa_frontend.Client.Layout.SuperPortalLayout
<div class="help-page"><h1>Executive portal help</h1><p class="lead">A quick guide to oversight across the school system.</p><section><h2>Overview</h2><p>Use the overview to see the main picture across administration, learners, finance, and staff activity. Use the links to move into the workspace that owns the task.</p></section><section><h2>Choosing the right workspace</h2><p>Use the admin workspace for learners, staff, academics, attendance, approvals, and reports. Use the finance workspace for accounts, payments, fees, and financial reporting.</p></section><section><h2>Reviewing information</h2><p>Check the date, term, year, and filters whenever comparing figures. A total number is not always the most useful measure; active learners and recent changes often give a clearer picture.</p></section><section><h2>Good governance</h2><p>Make changes in the workspace responsible for them, review sensitive updates, and avoid sharing account details outside authorised school staff.</p></section></div><style>.help-page{max-width:900px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 20px;color:#0f172a}.help-page h1{font-size:32px;margin:0 0 8px}.lead{color:#64748b;margin-bottom:26px}.help-page section{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin:14px 0;box-shadow:0 4px 14px #0f172a0a}.help-page h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px}.help-page p{line-height:1.65;color:#475569}</style>
